| [ ] | $[ ] | $[ ] | max(0, this transferor's liabilities − this transferor's aggregate basis), subject to exceptions = $[ ] | $[ ] | $[ ] | $[ ] | $[ ] | contributed basis − actual money received − FMV nonstock property − loss recognized + gain/dividend recognized − §358(d) liabilities + other adjustments = $[ ] | [ ] |

